  "notes": [
   "The minifigure (head, torso, legs, helmet, visor, shown on page 2 and seated in step 9) is not in the official parts list, so it is omitted from the graph.",
   "Exact stud positions of the round plates, side-handle plates, 1x2 plates and mudguards are inferred from small isometric drawings.",
   "Side handle plates (b6, b7) are assumed to be fixed to the 2x6 plate's underside end columns. The round plates (b2, b3) are assumed to sit under the middle columns, with the wheel-holder plates (b4, b5) under them as swivels.",
   "Layout of the jumper plates and grille tile on the two mudguards is inferred: the front mudguard carries two jumpers, and the rear carries the grille tile and one jumper.",
   "The flag clips onto the antenna shaft. The antenna has no clip port in the catalogue, so that edge uses a null port on the antenna.",
   "The tyres are pressed onto the wheels with no catalogue ports, so those edges use null ports."
  ]
